<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97576" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκάθ-ημαι</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκαθ-κάτημαι</span></b> , used as
			pf. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκαθέζομαι</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sit as assessor with</i>,
				[<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ Καίσαρι</span>] Wilcken <i><span class="en">
				<u>Chr.</u>
				14 ii 5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>; <i>live in the same quarters</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.68
			</span></i>; of a number of persons, <i>sit together</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				811
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				5.7.21
			</span></i>; esp. of persons sitting to deliberate, <i>sit in conclave,
				meet in assembly</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῇ Πυκνὶ . . πρόβατα -ήμενα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					32
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν συνεδρίῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					2.4.23
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ εἰρήνης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					5.55
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.115
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>sink</i> or <i>subside together, settle down</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				16.4
			</span></i>. 
			<i><span class="en">
				16
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς γόνυ συγκαθήμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Pseudol.</u>
					20
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
